Tabbed project dialog (1.8.0)

The project form was one long scroll, so reaching "access scope" meant
passing "price" and "tender" on the way. It is now split the way the
previous system split it: details, then settings and access.

Both panels stay mounted and are only hidden. Unmounting the inactive tab
would drop its fields from FormData, and saving would silently blank
them.

